F-8 | round-trips |\n| --- | --- | ---: | ---: |\n| `FF` (the vector's payload) | `EF BF BD` (U+FFFD) | yes | no |\n| `ED A0 80` (unpaired surrogate, WTF-8) | `ED A0 80` | no | yes |\n| `EF BF BD` (literal U+FFFD) | `EF BF BD` | yes | yes |\n\nWindows names are UTF-16; Go launders ill-formed UTF-8 into U+FFFD on the **write** path, so the test harness created a validly-named file and the guard rightly accepted it. Reads are lossless WTF-8, so the guard was already fail-closed. The bug was in the probe, not in path validation.\n\nTwo things I'm reporting against the routing brief:\n\n1. **The Windows Test-lane failure was not caused by PR 28.** It was `internal/managerlock TestSubprocessBuildKeyDeduplicationAcrossProjects`, a flake. The *identical* commit `062d89b` failed it in the `pull_request` run and passed it in the `workflow_dispatch` run; `GOOS=windows go list -deps ./internal/managerlock` has no edge to any changed package; it passes on the native Windows host.\n\n2. **PR 28 was wrong at the root, so I replaced it** with PR 30. Its `internal/fsunicode` refused every U+FFFD on Windows on a premise the measurements above disprove — it rejected literal U+FFFD names no laundering could produce and put a harness workaround into the identity path. PR 30 fixes the probe instead (unpaired surrogate on Windows, vector bytes elsewhere, plus an assertion that the directory really presents an invalid name) and reverts the product side byte-identically to its pre-PR-28 state.\n\nNative Windows, candidate root `curator-spec@859727b`: both invalid-unicode cases **PASS**, `internal/buildsource` full package ok. The two remaining `internal/godriver` Windows failures reproduce identically on unmodified `origin/main` on the same host — they belong to TASK-260823-czs1cx, confirmed by their own 1802 logbook entry.\n\nLocal: `go build`, `go vet`, `GOOS=windows go vet`, `golangci-lint run`, and the three-package test all exit 0. Evidence artifact attached to the board; logbook entry written. Not merging until `Test (windows-latest)` is verified green.","ttft_ms":2165,"ttft_stream_ms":1326,"time_to_request_ms":55,"type":"result","duration_ms":1271212,"uuid":"e8d1e68b-a1dd-4e8d-aed4-8d58fc92e375"}
